        "content": "<p>Hmm, I'm not sure I love how as of <a href=\"https://dataverse-guide--12319.org.readthedocs.build/en/12319/user/locally-fair.html\">https://dataverse-guide--12319.org.readthedocs.build/en/12319/user/locally-fair.html</a> Locally FAIR is at the same level as other docs directly under the user guide:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-08 at 2.08.25 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"616x506\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/53090/BU-yk7rezR7kQrGKKJYxU00u/Screenshot-2026-06-08-at-2.08.25PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/53090/BU-yk7rezR7kQrGKKJYxU00u/Screenshot-2026-06-08-at-2.08.25PM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>What do others think? <span aria-label=\"thinking\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f914\" role=\"img\" title=\"thinking\">:thinking:</span></p>",
